            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.3.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.3.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gave this charge to Joshua:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.3.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.3.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty says: 'If you will walk in obedience to me and keep my requirements, then you will govern my house and have charge of my courts, and I will give you a place among these standing here.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Listen, High Priest Joshua, you and your associates seated before you, who are men symbolic of things to come: I am going to bring my servant, the Branch.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "See, the stone I have set in front of Joshua! There are seven eyes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "on that one stone, and I will engrave an inscription on it,' says the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.3.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.3.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty, 'and I will remove the sin of this land in a single day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'In that day each of you will invite your neighbor to sit under your vine and fig tree,' declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.3.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.3.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
